HydraBBS Readme First file!
===========================

Thanks for reading this file first...

Some important points:

* For quickstart instructions, open HBBS.Guide and from the main menu
  select "Information" and then "QuickStart"

* Check for new updates in the web site at http://come.to/hydrabbs
  *before* you use this version of HydraBBS.
  (trust me, it'll save you some time...)

* If you've just installed HydraBBS and have downloaded some updates
  for it, then install those before you run HydraBBS (you'll have
  to have the HBBS: Assign set correctly first though, so double click
  the "Setup" icon, then install the updates)

  When you've installed the updates you will need to copy the updated
  example configurations from the updates to the HBBS directory, so
  execute the following commands from a shell prompt:

  COPY HBBS:Storage/Example_Configs/#? HBBS: ALL CLONE
  COPY HBBS:Storage/Example_Screens/Special/#? HBBS:Screens/Special ALL CLONE
  COPY HBBS:Storage/Example_Screens/Bulletins/#? HBBS:Screens/Bulletins ALL CLONE

  This is not done by the installer script to protect users who have already
  used their version of HydraBBS, as we wouldn't want any configs being
  overwritten!

* See "Changes.TXT" for important info if you're upgrading from a
  previous version.
  (Or if your Changes.TXT file was not been updated by the last upgrade,
  then see HBBS:Docs/Misc/Upgrades/UpgradeIndex.Guide)

* If you're upgrading from A15 to V1.0+ then check out the Utils directory
  for a program to update the user.data file, and do NOT run V1.0
  until you have done so!

* When you get new updates you should check the list of changed files,
  please see the files in HBBS:Docs/Misc/Upgrades for details.
